    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Within the last few decades, the valence of marijuana on the stage of public\r\nopinion has changed dramatically. As of 2020, 33 states have legalized\r\nmedical marijuana, and eleven have legalized marijuana for recreational use.\r\nIn this paper, I use word embeddings to explore changing media framing of marijuana, applying a potentially more granular methodology to see how media representations of charged topics change over time.",
